  "description": "Yun I-seo was living an ordinary life—far removed from the fantasies of his childhood.\nAfter winning the lottery by chance, he was celebrating wildly on a rainy, moonlit night when he was struck by a truck and transported to another world...\n\n*Wait, what? I’m the god of this world?! And to make matters worse, the cringeworthy novel I wrote during my awkward teenage years has become the state religion's holy scripture?!*\n\nFurious at the thought of the fortune he left behind in the real world, I-seo soon finds himself mired in a sticky predicament—until a man with a dazzling smile appears, plants a kiss on him, and saves him. Will I-seo ever be able to return to the real world?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/another_edgelord)",
